{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 48,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.3914794921875,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "the availability of facilities and resources. Appropriate clinical samples include sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.4376831054688,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "(expectorated or induced), gastric aspirates and other specimens depending on the site",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.4030151367188,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "of TB disease (e.g. lymph node biopsy). Fine-needle aspiration of enlarged lymph glands",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17767333984375,
        513.4834594726562,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "– for staining of acid-fast bacilli (AFB), culture and histology – has been shown to be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.10519409179688,
        301.6648864746094,
        160.52569580078125
      ],
      "text": "(16) useful, with a high bacteriological yield  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.68072509765625,
        513.35693359375,
        185.0322265625
      ],
      "text": "In young children TB is usually a paucibacillary disease, meaning that culture is much more",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.60824584960938,
        513.4261474609375,
        201.02874755859375
      ],
      "text": "M.  likely than microscopy to yield a positive diagnosis. In addition, culture differentiates",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        203.60476684570312,
        513.471923828125,
        217.0252685546875
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis  from non-tuberculous mycobacteria and allows drug susceptibility testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        219.6702880859375,
        446.4613952636719,
        233.02178955078125
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriological confirmation is especially important for children who have:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        241.99603271484375,
        258.30535888671875,
        255.46253967285156
      ],
      "text": "suspected drug-resistant TB  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        261.46533203125,
        183.7393798828125,
        274.93182373046875
      ],
      "text": "HIV infection -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        280.93463134765625,
        322.8204345703125,
        294.401123046875
      ],
      "text": "complicated or severe cases of TB disease -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        300.4039306640625,
        230.4063720703125,
        313.87042236328125
      ],
      "text": "an uncertain diagnosis -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        319.8731994628906,
        237.63987731933594,
        333.3396911621094
      ],
      "text": "been previously treated. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        341.5391845703125,
        513.3986206054688,
        354.89068603515625
      ],
      "text": "Note that TB in older children and adolescents is often similar to adult-type disease (and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        357.5356750488281,
        513.4100952148438,
        370.8871765136719
      ],
      "text": "so is not paucibacillary). In this age group, sputum is often readily available and is often",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        373.53216552734375,
        148.284912109375,
        386.8836669921875
      ],
      "text": "AFB-positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03630065917969,
        400.6990051269531,
        147.71229553222656,
        414.91900634765625
      ],
      "text": "HIV testing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        423.4464111328125,
        513.4375610351562,
        436.79791259765625
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing should be offered to all patients, including children, with presumptive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        439.3739013671875,
        513.3916015625,
        452.7944030761719
      ],
      "text": "(17) and diagnosed TB  . Chapter 6 gives further information on the management of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        455.43939208984375,
        214.97789001464844,
        468.7908935546875
      ],
      "text": "in children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        482.6069030761719,
        510.2233581542969,
        496.826904296875
      ],
      "text": "Investigations relevant for suspected pulmonary TB and suspected extrapul-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        497.00689697265625,
        145.723388671875,
        511.2268981933594
      ],
      "text": "monary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.6814575195312,
        206.01937866210938,
        533.1019287109375
      ],
      "text": "Suspected pulmonary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        544.2568969726562,
        513.3571166992188,
        557.6083984375
      ],
      "text": "Chest radiography is useful in the diagnosis of TB in children. In most cases, children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        560.25341796875,
        513.3914184570312,
        573.6049194335938
      ],
      "text": "with pulmonary TB have radiographic changes suggestive of TB; the commonest picture",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        576.2499389648438,
        513.3799438476562,
        589.6014404296875
      ],
      "text": "is one of persistent opacification in the lung together with enlarged hilar or subcarinal",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        592.2463989257812,
        513.4720458984375,
        605.597900390625
      ],
      "text": "lymph glands. A miliary pattern of opacification in HIV-negative children is highly",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        608.242919921875,
        168.1154022216797,
        621.5944213867188
      ],
      "text": "suggestive of TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        632.7494506835938,
        513.4605102539062,
        646.1009521484375
      ],
      "text": "Adolescent patients with TB have radiographic changes similar to adult patients, with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        648.7459106445312,
        513.4029541015625,
        662.097412109375
      ],
      "text": "large pleural effusions and apical infiltrates with cavity formation being the most",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        664.742431640625,
        513.4030151367188,
        678.0939331054688
      ],
      "text": "common forms of presentation. Adolescents may also develop primary disease with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        680.7389526367188,
        270.36187744140625,
        694.0904541015625
      ],
      "text": "hilar adenopathy and collapse lesions.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        705.2454223632812,
        513.3799438476562,
        718.596923828125
      ],
      "text": "Good-quality chest radiographs (including lateral view, if and where possible) are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        721.241943359375,
        513.4605102539062,
        734.5934448242188
      ],
      "text": "essential for proper evaluation and should preferably be read by a radiologist or a health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        737.2384643554688,
        513.4375610351562,
        750.5899658203125
      ],
      "text": "care worker trained in their reading. A practical guide for interpreting chest radiographs",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        753.1659545898438,
        355.80694580078125,
        766.58642578125
      ],
      "text": "(18) of children with suspected TB has been developed  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "29",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}